uelto rebelde y amenaza la supervivencia del mundo.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia ficción","Acción","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1119449","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:55:04.700Z"},{"id":"movie-1218069","slug":"movie-1218069","title":"Feucho (Yugly)","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v0k03CaQh6uFc5Ot8Jjhvr5BMYu.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Animación","Comedia","Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1218069","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:55:04.993Z"},{"id":"movie-1464883","slug":"movie-1464883","title":"La tarta del presidente","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9zfQ8eanWwkFA6S3YhZWle7jp75.jpg","synopsis":"Mientras la gente lucha a diario por sobrevivir bajo las sanciones en el Iraq de Sadam, Lamia, una niña de nueve años, debe usar su ingenio para reunir los ingredientes de la tarta obligatoria para celebrar el cumpleaños del presidente Sadam Husein o atenerse a las consecuencias: la cárcel o la muerte.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1464883","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:55:05.285Z"},{"id":"movie-1519780","slug":"movie-1519780","title":"Diary of a Wimpy Kid Christmas: The Getaway","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q6SR12TFod8m2izUb3b9eUCn7b.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"In Production","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Animación","Comedia","Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1519780","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:55:05.578Z"},{"id":"movie-798645","slug":"movie-798645","title":"The Running Man","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5WYxFamHLqroV0TilEw0RqBPzqG.jpg","synopsis":"En una América