,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/24428","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2012,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:57:25.312Z"},{"id":"movie-1291659","slug":"movie-1291659","title":"El mago del Kremlin","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bRIpjnIIbt6wkoG33QFnF9Z11BC.jpg","synopsis":"En medio del caos postsoviético de los años 90, el joven Vadim Baranov (Paul Dano) empieza a labrarse un camino como artista y productor de televisión. Su elocuencia y conexión con las altas esferas le llevan a convertirse, de la noche a la mañana, en el asesor de un agente del KGB con un brillante porvenir: Vladimir Putin (Jude Law). Desde las entrañas del poder, ambos darán forma a la nueva Rusia, difuminando los límites entre la verdad y la mentira.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1291659","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:57:25.605Z"},{"id":"movie-872585","slug":"movie-872585","title":"Oppenheimer","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mJRUREPjTqqMEKwEiM2sdmIGngz.jpg","synopsis":"Película sobre el físico J. Robert Oppenheimer y su papel como desarrollador de la bomba atómica. Basada en el libro 'American Prometheus: The Triumph and Tragedy of J. Robert Oppenheimer' de Kai Bird y Martin J. Sherwin.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Historia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/872585","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2023,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:57:25.892Z"},{"id":"movie-713364","slug":"movie-713364","title":"Cosecha sangrienta","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6YIN3L7lCYR1MiKNKjSg9as1Iz0.jpg","synopsis":"Quinn y su padre acaban de mudarse a la tranquila ciudad de Kettle Springs con la esperanza de empezar de cero. En su lugar, descubre una comunidad fracturada que ha atravesado tiempos difíciles tras el incendio de la preciada fábrica de sirope de maíz Baypen. Mientras los lugareños discuten entre sí y las tensiones se desbordan, una figura siniestra y sonriente emerge de los campos de maíz para limpiar el pueblo de sus cargas, víctima sangrienta a víctima. La verdadera diversión comienza cuando el payaso Frendo sale a jugar.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Misterio","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/713364","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:57:26.183Z"},{"id":"movie-1784301","slug":"movie-1784301","title":"مطلوب آيليان","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q863HBjksemYcEg2kWaRgZI68vh.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":[],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1784301","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:57:26.474Z"},{"id":"movie-1756943","slug":"movie-1756943","title":"Sex Drive","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5fPMOvgKCDmvJHL3zbeldOiTwDr.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1756943","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:57:26.762Z"},{"id":"movie-1383154","slug":"movie-1383154","title":"눈동자","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jOD0Z78Jo0njtJu1hlC27LEs78F.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1383154","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:57:27.064Z"},{"id":"movie-1590380","slug":"movie-1590380","title":"Ram and Leela","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j1X0t57PguWBcaa8LAOaAHGyjcK.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1590380","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:57:27.378Z