 proporcionar placeres sensuales inimaginables. Cotton convoca a estas criaturas, pero sólo le inflingirán tormentos y dolor hasta acabar con él. 20 años después, dos nuevos inquilinos se instalan en la antigua casa de Frank: su hermano y su esposa. La aparición del espíritu de Frank es el principio de una vorágine de horror en estado puro.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/9003","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1987,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:58:04.520Z"},{"id":"movie-1090869","slug":"movie-1090869","title":"El Señor de los Anillos: La caza de Gollum","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aRtIVdlgVNtvcqFUnuhR3V1RQ7o.jpg","synopsis":"Ambientada entre las trilogías de *El Hobbit* y *El Señor de los Anillos*, Trancos y Gandalf buscan al hobbit corrompido Gollum para obtener más información sobre el anillo de Bilbo Bolsón.","status":"In Production","country":null,"genres":["Fantasía","Aventura","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1090869","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2027,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:58:04.830Z"},{"id":"movie-1436219","slug":"movie-1436219","title":"Pizza Movies","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9mM5O5wWuBlD47y0lAqnPX28U0S.jpg","synopsis":"Una periodista cultural y crítica de cine en crisis convence a su marido de dejarlo todo y montar un negocio, pero no un uno cualquiera: una pizzería con temática de cine.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Romance","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1436219","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:58:05.130Z"},{"id":"movie-1250502","slug":"movie-1250502","title":"ഐ ആം ഗെയിം","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h1ezPKcMYv5FHbHDuHcZfTbWTY5.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Suspense","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sou