s":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1517123","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:58:18.309Z"},{"id":"movie-559","slug":"movie-559","title":"Spider-Man 3","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lkuQzlShE2uzJcsZYU4zBI4VQZP.jpg","synopsis":"Parece que Parker ha conseguido por fin el equilibrio entre su devoción por Mary Jane y sus deberes como superhéroe. Pero, de repente, su traje se vuelve negro y adquiere nuevos poderes; también él se transforma, mostrando el lado más oscuro y vengativo de su personalidad. Bajo la influencia del nuevo traje, Peter se convierte en un ser egoísta que sólo se preocupa por sí mismo. Tiene, pues, que afrontar un dilema: disfrutar de sus nuevos poderes o seguir siendo un héroe compasivo. Mientras tanto, sobre él se cierne la amenaza de dos temibles enemigos: Venom y el Hombre de Arena.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/559","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2007,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:58:18.600Z"},{"id":"movie-1789965","slug":"movie-1789965","title":"The Last Treatment","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3INKn3qhatQylvI9yonF1PhxFuN.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Crimen","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1789965","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:58:18.896Z"},{"id":"movie-1783608","slug":"movie-1783608","title":"冒牌暴徒","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zOlbnxjJYeqz8gTUMYrKFiHM2TZ.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":[],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1783608","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:58:19.195Z"},{"id":"movie-1169516","slug":"movie-1169516","title":"Welcome To The Jungle","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1JlfUuvvX5xLP2