dos con los resultados obtenidos. Pero cuando un problemático empleado manipula el sofisticado sistema de seguridad los dinosaurios escapan, obligando a los visitantes a luchar por su supervivencia.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/329","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1993,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:59:40.758Z"},{"id":"movie-1478476","slug":"movie-1478476","title":"কেউ বলে বিপ্লবী, কেউ বলে ডাকাত","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vT3VllVhSFw2D7t2M91WmM7Dsqc.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Historia","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1478476","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:59:41.063Z"},{"id":"movie-1146058","slug":"movie-1146058","title":"El pez pucheros","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fcDXgGL14qL46It1XOozEjX5Jws.jpg","synopsis":"Cuando se produce una catástrofe, el huraño y susceptible Pez Pucheros y su hiperactivo compañero, el dragón marino Pip, deben embarcarse en una aventura en busca de un pez mítico que les conceda el deseo de salvar sus hogares.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Familia","Aventura","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1146058","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:59:41.357Z"},{"id":"movie-1794221","slug":"movie-1794221","title":"学警出击","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1QjfySatShce6btLMAEMfqhecXi.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1794221","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:59:41.674Z"},{"id":"movie-1787995","slug":"movie-1787995","title":"Maltratada","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t9qcB9I5zY0Wtgt3YmPJYybHuml.jpg","synopsis"