a princesa Fiona regresan de su luna de miel, los padres de ella los invitan a visitar el reino de Muy Muy Lejano para celebrar la boda. Para Shrek, al que nunca abandona su fiel amigo Asno, esto constituye un gran problema. Los padres de Fiona, por su parte, no esperaban que su yerno tuviera un aspecto semejante y, mucho menos, que su hija hubiera cambiado tanto. Todo esto trastoca los planes del rey respecto al futuro del reino. Pero entonces entran en escena la maquiavélica Hada Madrina, su arrogante hijo el Príncipe Encantador y un minino muy especial: el Gato con Botas, experto cazador de ogros.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Familia","Fantasía","Romance"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/809","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2004,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:10.672Z"},{"id":"movie-1784657","slug":"movie-1784657","title":"Rage","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n30oBUumIjso0fWjIdqe2F7K60V.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1784657","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:10.968Z"},{"id":"movie-1770349","slug":"movie-1770349","title":"きんつくろい -金繕い-","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bLtaQN06LXF47V4OLhY5Doem6Vj.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":[],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1770349","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:11.261Z"},{"id":"movie-677561","slug":"movie-677561","title":"Los legendarios","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AlfndBQucnWC7igEIG2L0sk6tiF.jpg","synopsis":"Los Legendarios, intrépidos aventureros, eran los héroes más grandes de su época. Pero, a raíz de una terrible maldición, ¡se han convertido de nuevo en... niños de 10 años! Danaël, Jadina, Gryf, Shimy y Razzia unirán sus poderes para derrotar al hechicero Darkhell y liberar a su planeta de la infancia eterna...","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Acción","Aventura","Comedia","Familia","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/677561","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:11.550Z"},{"id":"movie-1572644","slug":"movie-1572644","title":"Double Kill","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lxdA8NPwwf1VBM53SxrYQgAHdKk.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1572644","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:11.842Z"},{"id":"movie-1754098","slug":"movie-1754098","title":"灵魂摆渡·天女之梦","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mHJXt12Sbhe4c1tZzRLxt19jByf.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1754098","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:12.140Z"},{"id":"movie-1728084","slug":"movie-1728084","title":"AEW All Out 2026","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Id93rTWF7zWT55Y16NtJ1lS1Am.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":[],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1728084","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:12.430Z"},{"id":"movie-1786738","slug":"movie-1786738","title":"Stream of Terror","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/39ZK8eBA4oTNMPzxuPyqKfcOGxb.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1786738","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:12.721Z"},{"id":"movie-1177529","slug":"movie-1177529","title":"Deathgasm 2: Goremageddon","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m3pFJuakpvK2eQ5q