migo, el capitán Barbossa le roba su barco, la Perla Negra, y ataca la ciudad de Port Royal, secuestrando a Elizabeth Swann, hija del gobernador. Will Turner, el amigo de la infancia de Elizabeth, se une a Jack para rescatarla y recuperar la Perla Negra. Pero el prometido de Elizabeth, comodoro Norrington, les persigue a bordo del HMS Impávido. Además, Barbossa y su tripulación son víctimas de un conjuro por el que están condenados a vivir eternamente, y a transformarse cada noche en esqueletos vivientes, en fantasmas guerreros.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/22","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2003,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:01:22.138Z"},{"id":"movie-1766767","slug":"movie-1766767","title":"가족은 아니고","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ixBxZQRGej6KNybwfwcAWbABEJk.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1766767","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:01:22.437Z"},{"id":"movie-1155818","slug":"movie-1155818","title":"Satluj - Punjab '95","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hm4ou83RwLVwNj3HsmQuqC1qkWy.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Crimen","Drama","Historia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1155818","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T14:01:22.732Z"},{"id":"movie-1466115","slug":"movie-1466115","title":"Aunque nuestro amor se desvanezca esta noche","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lawtchSE4FQch7kNTA5OiMTZ4F3.jpg","synopsis":"Una alumna de instituto despierta cada día sin recuerdos del día anterior. Al empezar a salir con un compañero tímido, su historia de amor se renueva con cada amanecer.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"ht